@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #2B2B2B
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #3b82f6
    LifeLineBorderColor #3b82f6
    ParticipantBorderColor #10b981
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #1a1f2e
    ParticipantFontColor #e8eaf0
    ActorBorderColor #f59e0b
    ActorBackgroundColor #1a1f2e
    ActorFontColor #e8eaf0
}

actor "User Request" as U
participant "WorkloadGenerator" as WG
participant "Agent Queue" as Q
participant "AdaptiveAllocator" as AA
participant "GPU Model" as GPU
participant "MetricsCollector" as MC

== Initialization (100s Window) ==
WG -> Q: Register Arrival Rates (λ)

== Request Lifecycle ==
U -> WG: Request Arrives
WG -> Q: Enqueue Request (FIFO)
note right: This is where delay builds\nif workers = 1

== Adaptive Scheduling Loop (Every 5s) ==
AA -> Q: Get Current State (λᵢ, Rᵢ, Pᵢ)
AA -> AA: Calculate Demand: dᵢ = (λᵢ * Rᵢ) / Pᵢ
AA -> GPU: Assign New GPU Share (gᵢ)

== Execution ==
Q -> GPU: Dequeue (1 worker process)
GPU -> GPU: Simulate Service Time\nscaled by gᵢ
GPU -> MC: Record Latency & Throughput
MC -> U: Response Complete

@enduml
